_3D.JointUseShortestRotationDirection [SimTalk]
Sets if the rotational joint of the object designated by <Path> uses the spatially shortest direction toward
its target orientations (true) or not (false).
Remarks
If the joint uses the spatially shortest direction, you cannot specify joint limits.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>._3D.JointUseShortestRotationDirection:boolean
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type boolean.
Example
MyCrane._3D.getObject(1).JointUseShortestRotationDirection := true
