_3D.Poses.EndPoseWasReached [SimTalk]
Returns if all pose runs for the object designated by <Path> came to an end (true) or not (false).
Remarks
It does not matter if the pose runs came to a regular end or if they were canceled with the methods
_3D.Poses.cancelMovement or _3D.Poses.stopMovement.
Pose runs that are only paused by _3D.Poses.pauseMovement or by failures or pauses, will not set
_3D.Poses.EndPoseWasReached to true.
Type
Read-only attribute
Syntax
<Path>._3D.Poses.EndPoseWasReached → boolean
Watchable
The read-only attribute is watchable.
Return Value
The return value has the data type boolean.
Example
Station._3D.Poses.moveTo("Pose1")
waituntil Station._3D.Poses.EndPoseWasReached
